OL,3,GNEWSAMother of Henry Nowak's killer
OL,4,Acould be released early
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of the man who murdered
OL,7,FHenry Nowak could be released from
OL,8,Fprison early as part of the
OL,9,Fgovernment's plan to tackle
OL,10,Fovercrowding in jails.
OL,12,FKiran Kaur, 53, was jailed for three
OL,13,Fyears in July for removing the knife
OL,14,Fher son, Vickrum Digwa, used to kill
OL,15,Fthe 18-year-old student in Southampton
OL,16,Fin December.
OL,18,FHampshire and Isle of Wight Police and
OL,19,FCrime Commissioner (PCC) Donna Jones
OL,20,Fsaid Kaur's early release would be "a
OL,21,Fsignificant blow for Henry's family".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
