OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMother of Henry Nowak's killer
OL,4,Acould be released early
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnder the Sentencing Act 2026, which
OL,7,Fcame into force on 1 October, most
OL,8,Fprisoners serving fixed-term sentences
OL,9,Fof up to two and a half years are
OL,10,Fautomatically released on licence after
OL,11,Fserving a third of the time, rather
OL,12,Fthan half.
